# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the team names.
# With "Require review from Code Owners" turned on in branch protection, changes to
# these paths cannot merge without the named humans — whatever an agent does.
# Later lines take precedence over earlier ones.

# Agent instructions at any depth (a nested AGENTS.md overrides the root one for its folder)
AGENTS.md                          @your-org/security
CLAUDE.md                          @your-org/security
GEMINI.md                          @your-org/security
/.agent/                           @your-org/security
/.claude/                          @your-org/security
/.cursor/                          @your-org/security
/.gemini/                          @your-org/security
/.github/copilot-instructions.md   @your-org/security
/.github/instructions/             @your-org/security

# Guardrails and pipelines
/.github/workflows/                @your-org/platform
/.pre-commit-config.yaml           @your-org/platform
/.github/CODEOWNERS                @your-org/security
